OL,3,AMore than 5,000 die from Ebola in DR
OL,4,ACongo's deadliest outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn its latest update, the health
OL,7,Fministry said the epicentre of the
OL,8,Fepidemic remains in the Ituri province,
OL,9,Fin the north-east of the country, which
OL,10,Fis a conflict zone, making it harder to
OL,11,Fcontain the virus.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
